flowchart TB
    subgraph HOST["HOST SYSTEM LAYER (Host CPU & Main System Memory — 16–32 GB DRAM)"]
        direction LR
        DRAM["<b>Host DRAM Tiered Cache Pool</b><br/>• Compressed INT4 KV Tensors (75% VRAM saved)<br/>• Swapped Inactive Sessions (Multi-turn)<br/>• Zero-Copy Pinned DMA Allocation"]
        CPU["<b>CPU Compute Delegation Engine</b><br/>• Harvests Idle CPU Cycles during decoding<br/>• Vectorized AVX-512 INT4 -> FP16 Dequantization<br/>• Zero GPU Stall Streaming Pipeline"]
        DRAM -->|"Decompress INT4"| CPU
    end

    subgraph BUS["PCIe Gen3 / Gen4 Motherboard Interconnect (~16–31.5 GB/s)"]
        PCIE["<b>Asynchronous DMA Pipeline</b><br/>Overlaps I/O Migration with GPU Attention Computation"]
    end

    subgraph GPU["TARGET ACCELERATOR LAYER (NVIDIA RTX 4060 8GB / 16GB VRAM)"]
        direction LR
        PE["<b>Attention-Based Priority Engine</b><br/>• Dynamic Priority Scorer (Weight x Recency)<br/>• PagedBlock Virtual Allocator<br/>• Selective INT4 Quantization for Eviction"]
        VRAM["<b>Active High-Priority KV Cache & Execution Core</b><br/>• Pinned Sinks (Initial 1–4 tokens in FP16)<br/>• Heavy-Hitter Tokens (Top 10–20% in FP16)<br/>• FlashAttention-2 Next-Token Decode Loop"]
        PE -->|"Retain FP16 Context"| VRAM
    end

    PE ==>|"1. Offload INT4 (Saves 75% VRAM)"| DRAM
    CPU ==>|"2. Stream Dequantized FP16 (Prefetch)"| VRAM

